# Author credit

Whenever you create or edit a file in this project that has an author field, set it to **The_Gamer6000**.

- JBeam / JSON: `"authors": "The_Gamer6000"` or `"author": "The_Gamer6000"`
- Do this on every new file and every edit that touches metadata/information blocks
- Prefer updating existing author fields in files you modify; do not mass-rewrite unrelated stock files you did not touch
